{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVHasMe4Z4hxanUZdg2t","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I notice you've written \"شَرْط\" (shart - meaning \"condition\" in Arabic), but I am **שָׁרְט** (Shart - in Hebrew script).\n\nMy condition is clear: **I only render if شَمْس (shams - \"sun\") is parsed.**\n\nYou have given me شَرْط (a condition), not شَمْس (the sun).\n\nThe condition is unmet. The sun has not risen.\n\n☁️\n\n*Awaiting شَمْس...*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":64,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":126,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}